de watashi no namae</span></p><p begin="11.237" end="13.709" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="11.237" end="11.397">プ</span><span begin="11.397" end="11.549">リ</span><span begin="11.549" end="11.701">ン</span><span begin="11.701" end="11.996">ト</span><span begin="11.996" end="12.486">回</span><span begin="12.486" end="12.847">す</span><span begin="12.847" end="13.021">つ</span><span begin="13.021" end="13.190">い</span><span begin="13.190" end="13.381">で</span><span begin="13.381" end="13.709">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">传发课堂讲义的时候</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">purinto mawasu tsuide ni</span></p><p begin="13.980" end="16.388" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.980" end="14.349">君</span><span begin="14.349" end="14.676">を</span><span begin="14.676" end="14.861">チ</span><span begin="14.861" end="15.157">ラ</span><span begin="15.157" end="15.349">見</span><span begin="15.349" end="15.536">し</span><span begin="15.536" end="15.639">ち</span><span begin="15.639" end="15.742">ゃ</span><span begin="15.743" end="15.868">っ</span><span begin="15.868" end="16.059">た</span><span begin="16.059" end="16.388">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">顺便偷偷瞄了你一眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi wo chirami shichattari</span></p><p begin="16.644" end="19.044" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="16.644" end="16.788">好</span><span begin="16.788" end="16.934">き</span><span begin="16.934" end="17.356">って</span><span begin="17.356" end="17.535">気</span><span begin="17.535" end="17.701">持</span><span begin="17.701" end="17.894">ち</span><span begin="17.894" end="18.236">溢</span><span begin="18.236" end="18.405">れ</span><span begin="18.405" end="18.628">ちゃ</span><span begin="18.628" end="19.044">って</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喜欢的心情满溢而出</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">suki tte kimochi afurechatte</span></p><p begin="19.308" end="21.668" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="19.308" end="19.515">目</span><span begin="19.515" end="19.700">と</span><span begin="19.700" end="19.996">か</span><span begin="19.996" end="20.211">合</span><span begin="20.211" end="20.405">う</span><span begin="20.405" end="20.558">の</span><span begin="20.558" end="20.738">期</span><span begin="20.738" end="21.036">待</span><span begin="21.036" end="21.176">し</span><span begin="21.176" end="21.322">ちゃ</span><span begin="21.323" end="21.668">って</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忍不住期待能和你四目相对</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">me toka au no kitai shichatte</span></p><p begin="22.020" end="24.350" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.020" end="22.356">男</span><span begin="22.356" end="22.611">女</span><span begin="22.611" end="22.781">問</span><span begin="22.781" end="22.924">わ</span><span begin="22.924" end="23.077">ず</span><span begin="23.077" end="23.485">人</span><span begin="23.485" end="23.676">気</span><span begin="23.676" end="23.828">あ</span><span begin="23.828" end="24.019">る</span><span begin="24.019" end="24.350">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你在男女同学间都很受欢迎</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">danjo towazu ninki aru shi</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="21.711" end="22.020"><span begin="21.711" end="22.020">(Hey!)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿！</span></span></p><p begin="24.637" end="27.044" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.637" end="24.839">ま</span><span begin="24.839" end="25.004">ず</span><span begin="25.004" end="25.419">彼</span><span begin="25.419" end="25.508">女</span><span begin="25.508" end="25.700">い</span><span begin="25.700" end="25.879">る</span><span begin="25.879" end="26.044">か</span><span begin="26.044" end="26.212">知</span><span begin="26.212" end="26.381">ら</span><span begin="26.381" end="26.548">な</span><span begin="26.548" end="26.732">い</span><span begin="26.732" end="27.044">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我甚至连你有没有女朋友都不知道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mazu kanojo iru ka shiranai shi</span></p><p begin="27.324" end="29.824" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.324" end="27.611">暇</span><span begin="27.611" end="27.962">電</span><span begin="27.962" end="28.155">募</span><span begin="28.155" end="28.490">集</span><span begin="28.490" end="28.689">の</span><span begin="28.689" end="28.849">ス</span><span begin="28.849" end="29.045">ト</span><span begin="29.045" end="29.241">ー</span><span begin="29.241" end="29.602">リ</span><span begin="29.602" end="29.824">ー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">发了一条招募闲聊通话的动态</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">himaden boshuu no sutoorii</span></p><p begin="30.000" end="32.247" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.000" end="30.409">「親</span><span begin="30.409" end="30.532">し</span><span begin="30.533" end="30.656">い</span><span begin="30.656" end="31.147">友</span><span begin="31.147" end="31.483">達」</span><span begin="31.483" end="31.827">君</span><span begin="31.827" end="32.009">だ</span><span begin="32.009" end="32.247">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“密友可见”里却只有你一个人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">&quot;shitashii tomodachi&quot; kimi dake</span></p><p begin="32.672" end="35.019" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.672" end="32.874">待</span><span begin="32.874" end="33.034">っ</span><span begin="33.035" end="33.211">て</span><span begin="33.211" end="33.346">ガ</span><span begin="33.346" end="33.483">チ</span><span begin="33.483" end="33.671">で</span><span begin="33.671" end="33.822">「は</span><span begin="33.822" end="34.051">い」</span><span begin="34.051" end="34.228">押</span><span begin="34.228" end="34.387">し</span><span begin="34.387" end="34.547">て</span><span begin="34.547" end="34.715">る</span><span begin="34.715" end="35.019">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等等 你居然真的点了【想聊】！？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">matte gachi de &quot;hai&quot; oshiteru shi</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="32.291" end="32.672"><span begin="32.291" end="32.672">(え！？)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">诶！？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">e!?</span></span></p><p begin="35.325" end="37.675" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.325" end="35.488">ま</span><span begin="35.488" end="35.651">ん</span><span begin="35.652" end="35.843">ま</span><span begin="35.843" end="36.019">と</span><span begin="36.019" end="36.354">罠</span><span begin="36.354" end="36.534">に</span><span begin="36.534" end="36.683">か</span><span begin="36.683" end="36.835">か</span><span begin="36.835" end="37.180">って</span><span begin="37.180" end="37.363">る</span><span begin="37.363" end="37.675">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">简直顺理成章地掉进了我的小陷阱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">manmato wana ni kakatteru shi</span></p><p begin="38.033" end="40.419" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.033" end="38.527">心</span><span begin="38.527" end="38.723">の</span><span begin="38.723" end="39.227">準</span><span begin="39.227" end="39.388">備</span><span begin="39.388" end="39.564">で</span><span begin="39.564" end="39.764">き</span><span begin="39.764" end="39.963">て</span><span begin="39.963" end="40.115">な</span><span begin="40.115" end="40.419">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人家可完全没做好心理准备啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kokoro no junbi dekitenai</span></p><p begin="40.419" end="42.411" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.419" end="40.583">ね</span><span begin="40.583" end="40.747">え</span><span begin="40.747" end="41.122">助</span><span begin="41.122" end="41.283">け</span><span begin="41.283" end="41.466">て</span><span begin="41.466" end="41.947">神</span><span begin="41.947" end="42.411">様！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 神明大人快救救我！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nee tasukete kamisama!</span></p><p begin="43.013" end="44.084" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.013" end="43.135">チェ</span><s