="1:09.655" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.313" end="1:07.655">「ノ</span><span begin="1:07.655" end="1:07.719">ー</span><span begin="1:07.719" end="1:08.060">ト</span><span begin="1:08.060" end="1:08.227">見</span><span begin="1:08.227" end="1:08.432">せ</span><span begin="1:08.432" end="1:08.822">て」</span><span begin="1:08.822" end="1:08.822">っ</span><span begin="1:08.822" end="1:08.998">て</span><span begin="1:08.998" end="1:09.212">ちょ</span><span begin="1:09.213" end="1:09.320">っ</span><span begin="1:09.320" end="1:09.655">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“笔记借我看下”等一下啦！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">&quot;nooto misete&quot; tte chotto</span></p><p begin="1:09.967" end="1:12.316" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.967" end="1:10.199">い</span><span begin="1:10.199" end="1:10.351">つ</span><span begin="1:10.351" end="1:10.656">も</span><span begin="1:10.656" end="1:10.847">寝</span><span begin="1:10.847" end="1:11.130">て</span><span begin="1:11.130" end="1:11.542">る</span><span begin="1:11.542" end="1:11.703">か</span><span begin="1:11.703" end="1:11.847">ら</span><span begin="1:11.847" end="1:11.992">で</span><span begin="1:11.992" end="1:12.316">しょ？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还不是因为你上课总在打瞌睡？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsumo neteru kara desho?</span></p><p begin="1:12.690" end="1:15.069" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:12.690" end="1:12.830">な</span><span begin="1:12.831" end="1:13.002">ん</span><span begin="1:13.002" end="1:13.346">て</span><span begin="1:13.346" end="1:13.506">言</span><span begin="1:13.506" end="1:13.945">って</span><span begin="1:13.945" end="1:14.142">本</span><span begin="1:14.142" end="1:14.276">当</span><span begin="1:14.276" end="1:14.412">は</span><span begin="1:14.412" end="1:14.678">嬉</span><span begin="1:14.678" end="1:14.788">し</span><span begin="1:14.788" end="1:15.069">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘴上这么吐槽着 心里其实开心得不行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nante itte hontou wa ureshii</span></p><p begin="1:15.334" end="1:17.834" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:15.334" end="1:15.543">待</span><span begin="1:15.543" end="1:15.752">っ</span><span begin="1:15.752" end="1:16.029">て</span><span begin="1:16.029" end="1:16.206">名</span><span begin="1:16.206" end="1:16.505">前</span><span begin="1:16.505" end="1:16.681">消</span><span begin="1:16.681" end="1:16.857">し</span><span begin="1:16.857" end="1:17.033">て</span><span begin="1:17.033" end="1:17.200">な</span><span begin="1:17.200" end="1:17.393">い</span><span begin="1:17.393" end="1:17.834">し！？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等等… 笔记本上的名字还没擦掉呢！？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">matte namae keshitenai shi!?</span></p><p begin="1:18.107" end="1:20.369" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.107" end="1:18.274">あ</span><span begin="1:18.275" end="1:18.442">ー</span><span begin="1:18.442" end="1:18.595">あ、</span><span begin="1:18.849" end="1:19.085">も</span><span begin="1:19.085" end="1:19.321">う</span><span begin="1:19.321" end="1:19.497">お</span><span begin="1:19.497" end="1:19.673">し</span><span begin="1:19.673" end="1:19.834">ま</span><span begin="1:19.834" end="1:20.033">い</span><span begin="1:20.033" end="1:20.369">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊——啊 这下全完蛋了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">aa-a mou oshimai da</span></p><p begin="1:20.649" end="1:23.067" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.649" end="1:21.009">絶</span><span begin="1:21.009" end="1:21.527">対</span><span begin="1:21.527" end="1:21.644">見</span><span begin="1:21.644" end="1:21.873">ら</span><span begin="1:21.873" end="1:22.193">れ</span><span begin="1:22.193" end="1:22.428">ちゃ</span><span begin="1:22.428" end="1:22.545">っ</span><span begin="1:22.545" end="1:22.723">た</span><span begin="1:22.723" end="1:23.067">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝对已经被你看见了吧</span><span ttm:role="x-r