"1:38.592">の</span><span begin="1:38.592" end="1:38.783">か</span><span begin="1:38.783" end="1:39.057">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在说不定就是心动拉满的高潮情节呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">gekiatsu tenkai na no kamo</span></p><p begin="1:39.360" end="1:41.744" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.360" end="1:39.577">で</span><span begin="1:39.577" end="1:39.662">も</span><span begin="1:39.662" end="1:39.833">メ</span><span begin="1:39.833" end="1:40.003">イ</span><span begin="1:40.003" end="1:40.180">ク</span><span begin="1:40.180" end="1:40.453">も</span><span begin="1:40.453" end="1:40.652">勉</span><span begin="1:40.652" end="1:40.997">強</span><span begin="1:40.997" end="1:41.157">し</span><span begin="1:41.157" end="1:41.321">た</span><span begin="1:41.321" end="1:41.744">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不过化妆我也认真学过了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">demo meiku mo benkyou shita shi</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:38.966" end="1:39.311"><span begin="1:38.966" end="1:39.311">(Hey!)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿！</span></span></p><p begin="1:42.001" end="1:44.348" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.001" end="1:42.185">ダ</span><span begin="1:42.185" end="1:42.393">イ</span><span begin="1:42.393" end="1:42.673">エッ</span><span begin="1:42.673" end="1:42.889">ト</span><span begin="1:42.889" end="1:43.120">も</span><span begin="1:43.120" end="1:43.273">サ</span><span begin="1:43.273" end="1:43.393">ボ</span><span begin="1:43.393" end="1:43.690">って</span><span begin="1:43.690" end="1:43.841">な</span><span begin="1:43.841" end="1:43.981">い</span><span begin="1:43.981" end="1:44.348">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">减脂塑形也从来没有偷懒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">daietto mo sabottenai shi</span></p><p begin="1:44.661" end="1:47.045" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.661" end="1:44.847">あ</span><span begin="1:44.847" end="1:45.012">と</span><span begin="1:45.012" end="1:45.196">は</span><span begin="1:45.196" end="1:45.517">君</span><span begin="1:45.517" end="1:45.693">に</span><span begin="1:45.693" end="1:46.005">伝</span><span begin="1:46.005" end="1:46.183">え</span><span begin="1:46.183" end="1:46.372">る</span><span begin="1:46.372" end="1:46.709">勇</span><span begin="1:46.709" end="1:47.045">気</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">剩下的就只有向你传达心意的勇气了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ato wa kimi ni tsutaeru yuuki</span></p><p begin="1:47.189" end="1:49.106" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.189" end="1:47.333">ね</span><span begin="1:47.333" end="1:47.477">え</span><span begin="1:47.477" end="1:47.630">お</span><span begin="1:47.630" end="1:47.917">願</span><span begin="1:47.917" end="1:48.125">い</span><span begin="1:48.125" end="1:48.557">神</span><span begin="1:48.557" end="1:49.106">様！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 拜托了神明大人！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nee onegai kamisama!</span></p><p begin="1:49.642" end="1:50.753" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.642" end="1:49.775">チェ</span><span begin="1:49.775" end="1:49.841">ッ</span><span begin="1:49.842" end="1:50.017">ク！</span> <span begin="1:50.017" end="1:50.134">チェ</span><span begin="1:50.134" end="1:50.194">ッ</span><span begin="1:50.194" end="1:50.362">ク！</span> <span begin="1:50.362" end="1:50.479">チェ</span><span begin="1:50.479" end="1:50.537">ッ</span><span begin="1:50.538" end="1:50.753">ク！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Check! Check! Check!</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">chekku! chekku! chekku!</span></p><p begin="1:50.753" end="1:52.383" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.753" end="1:51.162">運</span><span begin="1:51.162" end="1:51.506">勢</span><span begin="1:51.506" end="1:51.698">は</span><span begin="1:51.698" end="1:52.026">良</span><span begin="1:52.026" end="1:52.383">好！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今日运势非常良好！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">unsei wa ryoukou!</span></p><p begin="1:52.383" end="1:54.969" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.383" end="1:52.551">だ</span><span begin="1:52.551" end="1:52.872">って</span><span begin="1:52.872" end="1:53.374">私</span><span begin="1:53.374" end="1:53.551">キ</span><span begin="1:53.551" end="1:53.839">ラ</span><span begin="1:53.839" end="1:53.991">キ</span><span begin="1:53.991" end="1:54.152">ラ</span><span begin="1:54.152" end="1:54.376">の</span> <span begin="1:54.376" end="1:54.725">J</span><span begin="1:54.725" end="1:54.969">K</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毕竟我可是闪耀迷人的 JK</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">datte watashi kirakira no JK</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:54.366" end="1:55.354"><span begin="1:54.366" end="1:54.600">(キュ</span><span begin="1:54.600" end="1:54.714">ン！</span> <span begin="1:54.714" end="1:54.877">キュ</span><span begin="1:54.877" end="1:54.970">ン！</span> <span begin="1:54.970" end="1:55.197">キュ</span><span begin="1:55.197" end="1:55.354">ン！)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心跳！心跳！怦然心动！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kyun! kyun! kyun!</span></span></p><p begin="1:55.183" end="2:00.074" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.183" end="1:55.566">恋</span><span begin="1:55.566" end="1:55.871">の</span><span begin="1:55.871" end="1:56.463">方</span><span begin="1:56.463" end="1:56.863">程</span><span begin="1:56.863" end="1:57.333">式</span> <span begin="1:57.660" end="1:58.190">先</span><span begin="1:58.190" end="1:58.890">生</span><span begin="1:58.890" end="1:59.365">教</span><span begin="1:59.365" end="1:59.514">え</span><span begin="1:59.514" end="1:59.714">て</span><span begin="1:59.714" end="2:00.074">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恋爱的方程式 老师请快教教我吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">koi no houteishiki sensei oshiete yo</span></p><p begin="2:00.330" end="2:01.379" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.330" end="2:00.439">ち</span><span begin="2:00.439" end="2:00.548">ゅ！</span> <span begin="2:00.658" end="2:00.770">ち</span><span begin="2:00.770" end="2:00.882">ゅ！</span> <span begin="2:00.994" end="2:01.124">ち</span><span begin="2:01.124" end="2:01.379">ゅ！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Chu! Chu! Chu!</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">chu! chu! chu!</span></p><p begin="2:01.379" end="2:03.003" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.379" end="2:01.764">新</span><span begin="2:01.764" end="2:02.149">作</span><span begin="2:02.149" end="2:02.348">の</span><span begin="2:02.348" end="2:02.511">リ</span><span begin="2:02.511" end="2:02.674">ッ</span><span begin="2:02.675" end="2:03.003">プ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">涂上了新款的唇釉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shinsaku no rippu</span></p><p begin="2:03.003" end="2:06.088" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.003" end="2:03.246">可</span><span begin="2:03.246" end="2:03.542">愛</span><span begin="2:03.543" end="2:03.720">い</span><span begin="2:03.720" end="2:04.511">私</span><span begin="2:04.511" end="2:04.714">で</span><span begin="2:04.714" end="2:05.024">君</span><span begin="2:05.024" end="2:05.212">に</span><span begin="2:05.212" end="2:05.376">会</span><span begin="2:05.376" end="2:05.532">い</span><span begin="2:05.532" end="2:05.703">た</span><span begin="2:05.703" end="2:06.088">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想以最可爱的模样与你相见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kawaii watashi de kimi ni aitai</span></p><p begin="2:06.376" end="2:11.338" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.376" end="2:06.589">ね</span><span begin="2:06.589" end="2:06.801">え</span> <span begin="2:07.016" end="2:07.700">デ</span><span begin="2:07.700" end="2:08.384">ー</span><span begin="2:08.384" end="2:09.032">ト</span><span begin="2:09.032" end="2:09.711">に</span><span begin="2:09.711" end="2:10.068">誘</span><span begin="2:10.070" end="2:10.179">っ</span><span begin="2:10.179" end="2:10.507">て</span><span begin="2:10.507" end="2:10.670">い</span><span begin="2:10.670" end="2:10.872">い</span><span begin="2:10.872" end="2:11.032">か</span><span begin="2:11.032" end="2:11.338">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 我可以主动约你出去吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nee deeto ni sasotte ii kana</span></p><p begin="2:11.338" end="2:14.034" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.338" end="2:11.683">君</span><span begin="2:11.683" end="2:11.938">を</span><span begin="2:11.938" end="2:12.247">思</span><span begin="2:12.247" end="2:12.325">う</span><span begin="2:12.325" end="2:12.677">と</span><span begin="2:12.677" end="2:13.029">夜</span><span begin="2:13.029" end="2:13.203">も</span><span begin="2:13.203" end="2:13.490">眠</span><span begin="2:13.490" end="2:13.666">れ</span><span begin="2:13.666" end="2:13.818">な</span><span begin="2:13.818" end="2:14.034">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要一想到你 夜晚就辗转难眠</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi wo omou to yoru mo nemurenai</span></p><p begin="2:14.034" end="2:16.708" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:14.034" end="2:14.412">君</span><span begin="2:14.412" end="2:14.626">の</span><span begin="2:14.626" end="2:15.082">頭</span><span begin="2:15.082" end="2:15.227">の</span><span begin="2:15.227" end="2:15.554">中</span><span begin="2:15.554" end="2:15.644">に</span><span begin="2:15.644" end="2:16.051">私</span><span begin="2:16.051" end="2:16.197">は</span><span begin="2:16.197" end="2:16.356">い</span><span begin="2:16.356" end="2:16.501">な</span><span begin="2:16.501" end="2:16.708">い？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的脑海里是不是根本没有我呢？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi no atama no naka ni watashi wa inai?</span></p><p begin="2:16.351" end="2:18.879" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:16.351" end="2:16.714">人</span><span begin="2:16.714" end="2:16.841">生</span><span begin="2:16.841" end="2:17.098">一</span><span begin="2:17.098" end="2:17.226">度</span><span begin="2:17.226" end="2:17.391">き</span><span begin="2:17.391" end="2:17.578">り！</span> <span begin="2:17.721" end="2:18.034">後</span><span begin="2:18.034" end="2:18.268">悔</span><span begin="2:18.268" end="2:18.406">し</span><span begin="2:18.406" end="2:18.579">た</span><span begin="2:18.579" end="2:18.693">く</span><span begin="2:18.693" end="2:18.776">な</span><span begin="2:18.776" end="2:18.879">い！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人生只有这么一次！我才不要留下遗憾！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">jinsei ichido kiri! koukai shitakunai!</span></p><p begin="2:18.879" end="2:21.619" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.879" end="2:19.092">君</span><span begin="2:19.092" end="2:19.306">だ</span><span begin="2:19.306" end="2:19.458">け</span><span begin="2:19.458" end="2:19.625">に</span><span begin="2:19.625" end="2:19.929">届</span><span begin="2:19.929" end="2:20.161">け</span><span begin="2:20.161" end="2:20.237">た</span><span begin="2:20.237" end="2:20.282">い</span> <span begin="2:20.420" end="2:20.787">Love</span> <span begin="2:20.787" end="2:21.020">you</span> <span begin="2:21.020" end="2:21.619">baby</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只想传达给你一个人 Love you baby</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">jinsei ichido kiri! koukai shitakunai!</span></p><p begin="2:22.002" end="2:24.365" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.002" end="2:22.251">つ</span><span begin="2:22.251" end="2:22.411">い</span><span begin="2:22.411" end="2:22.587">に</span><span begin="2:22.587" end="2:22.746">来</span><span begin="2:22.746" end="2:22.933">ちゃ</span><span begin="2:22.933" end="2:23.026">っ</span><span begin="2:23.027" end="2:23.275">た</span><span begin="2:23.275" end="2:23.466">運</span><span begin="2:23.466" end="2:23.858">命</span><span begin="2:23.858" end="2:23.980">の</span><span begin="2:23.980" end="2:24.365">日</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">命中注定的这天终于到来了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tsui ni kichatta unmei no hi</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:21.673" end="2:22.002"><span begin="2:21.673" end="2:22.002">(Hey!)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿！</span></span></p><p begin="2:24.668" end="2:27.074" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:24.668" end="2:24.886">私</span><span begin="2:24.886" end="2:25.228">服</span><span begin="2:25.228" end="2:25.373">の</span><span begin="2:25.373" end="2:25.757">君</span><span begin="2:25.757" end="2:25.917">も</span><span begin="2:25.917" end="2:26.034">か</span><span begin="2:26.034" end="2:26.225">っ</span><span begin="2:26.225" end="2:26.357">こ</span><span begin="2:26.357" end="2:26.527">い</span><span begin="2:26.527" end="2:26.697">い</span><span begin="2:26.697" end="2:27.074">な！？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿私服的你也太帅气了吧！？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shifuku no kimi mo kakkoii na!?</span></p><p begin="2:27.386" end="2:29.744" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:27.386" end="2:27.746">顔</span><span begin="2:27.746" end="2:28.058">赤</span><span begin="2:28.058" end="2:28.250">く</span><span begin="2:28.250" end="2:28.402">な</span><span begin="2:28.402" end="2:28.594">い</span><span begin="2:28.594" end="2:28.763">か</span><span begin="2:28.763" end="2:28.993">な？</span><span begin="2:28.993" end="2:29.243">心</span><span begin="2:29.243" end="2:29.744">配…</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的脸没有很红吧？好担心…</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kao akakunai kana? shinpai...</span></p><p begin="2:30.009" end="2:32.401" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:30.009" end="2:30.241">ド</span><span begin="2:30.241" end="2:30.398">キ</span><span begin="2:30.398" end="2:30.569">ド</span><span begin="2:30.569" end="2:30.738">キ</span><span begin="2:30.738" end="2:31.057">始</span><span begin="2:31.057" end="2:31.209">ま</span><span begin="2:31.209" end="2:31.401">る</span><span begin="2:31.401" end="2:31.713">初</span><span begin="2:31.713" end="2:3